WEBVTT

00:10:59.356 --> 00:11:01.916
Or I do, but we’d be here all day.

00:11:01.956 --> 00:11:03.636
But I will say two things.

00:11:04.356 --> 00:11:07.636
The first thing is that
using immersive technology

00:11:07.676 --> 00:11:10.596
is not the future
of workplace communication.

00:11:10.636 --> 00:11:12.516
It's the present.

00:11:12.556 --> 00:11:14.636
Organizations, large and small,

00:11:14.676 --> 00:11:18.036
are already providing VR headsets
to their employees

00:11:18.076 --> 00:11:21.156
the same way that they would
traditionally just provide a laptop,

00:11:21.156 --> 00:11:23.956
to help their teams feel closer together,

00:11:23.996 --> 00:11:27.276
to encourage trust
and to grow relationships.

00:11:27.276 --> 00:11:29.716
Secondly, and importantly,